 (Stephen Hough)</div>","language":"eng","licenseurl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.7.0","subject":"radio show; Concert Grande; Bruce Posner; Joe Patrych","title":"Concert Grande - \"Our Favorite Encores\", 3-6-1990","uploader":"bfposner@pipeline.com","publicdate":"2022-10-31 19:49:55","addeddate":"2022-10-31 19:49:55"},"server":"ia601405.us.archive.org","uniq":2068874773,"workable_servers":["ia601405.us.archive.org","ia801405.us.archive.org"]}